# production
# Committed on purpose: PythonAnywhere's free tier has a 512MB disk quota
# that a full node_modules install blows through (~765MB locally), so
# Node.js never runs there at all — the prebuilt output is committed here
# and PythonAnywhere just `git pull`s it. See django-backend/PYTHONANYWHERE_DEPLOY.md.
!/build

